ghts on how to improve your dating profile. Will it be burgers or sushi for your first date? Let the games begin!\r\n\r\nUPGRADES TO ROCK YOUR WORLD\r\n1. Unlock your Likes page with See Who Liked You - Now you\u2019ll know who\u2019s interested from the get-go and see who already swiped right on you. \r\n\r\n2. Wow them before you\u2019ve even matched - Found a potential date and feeling lovestruck? Use Wow to message someone from your swipe queue before you've even matched! Send a personalized message to stand out and make sure they notice you.\r\n\r\n3. Get up to 12x more matches and messages with #Dating Premium, which includes four different benefits:\r\n\u2022 Unlimited Likes: At #Dating, we\u2019re all about genuine connections, that\u2019s why we have a daily swipe limit. However, if you don't want to rest until you\u2019ve found the one, remove the swipe limit with Unlimited Likes!\r\n\u2022 Message Highlight: Take your message to the top with Message Highlight. Now your messages will stand out in your match's inbox, boosting your chances of a reply.\r\n\u2022 Priority Profile: Skip to the front of the swipe queue with Priority Profile and be seen by even more people. More people means more potential matches!\r\n\u2022 Swipe Rewind: Maybe you changed your mind or were too quick to judge. So with Swipe Rewind, you can easily redo your last like or dislike.\r\n\r\nFollow us on social media to stay in the loop:\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/hashtagdating\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/hashtagdatingofficial\r\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@hashtagdating\r\n\r\nFor more information, read our Privacy Policy and Terms of Use:\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://m.locanto.com/m/dol/privacy/\r\nTerms of Use: https://m.locanto.com/m/dol/terms/\r\n\r\nBrought to you by the developers of Locanto (Yalwa).",
